    "title": "Lawton Inmate Stabbed Nine Times in Back During Meal Line, Warrant Says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordan Myers ,\n13 hours ago\nA former inmate at a Lawton prison is accused of stabbing another man in the back nine times while the two waited in line to receive meals, according to court records. Pedro Fuentes, 47, now faces a felony arrest warrant stemming from the attack, which left the other inmate hospitalized for his injuries.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
